// The Threshold: the survival map. One road along a coast, between the
// mountains and the sea, into a Precursor facility that fills the east half
// of the map. Late in the day, fair: the low sun rakes the plateau and the
// facility's light is the brightest thing on it.
// Positions are metres, x east, y north, from the south-west corner. They
// match crates/mc-map/src/bake/threshold.rs (its `threshold_block` test
// prints the facility block); crates/mc-map/tests/threshold.rs holds them to
// the baked terrain.
